KNOWNBUG
dead_end1.sv
--bound 10
^\[main\.p0\] .*: PROVED up to bound 10$
^no path with 11 states satisfies the constraints and assumptions; the results for bound 10 are vacuous$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
BMC considers the paths with bound + 1 states, which must satisfy the
assumption in every state. No path does beyond the state with cnt == 4,
and hence p0 holds vacuously with a bound of 5 or more, whereas a bound of
3 or 4 refutes it (dead_end1.bound4.desc). The vacuity is not reported.
